1 NAME Ludvig /Torkelson Ølberg/
2 GIVN Ludvig
2 SURN Torkelson Ølberg
2 _MARNM Kaarck
2 NICK Cork
2 NICK Kork
2 NICK Korch
1 SEX M
1 BAPM
2 DATE 29 SEP 1781
1 BIRT
2 DATE 29 SEP 1781
