1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Reiste til Amerika og blei gift der med Johanna.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/120945710/gabriel-gabrielson
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT (
2 CONT Gabriel Gabrielsen was born on July 27, 1856 in Rogaland County, Norway, the son of Gabriel (the son of Gabriel) and Ingeborg Marie (the daughter of Peder). He was baptized on August 17, 1856. Gabriel married Johanne Olsdatter (da
2 CONC ughter of Ole) on July 2, 1878 in Klepp, Rogaland, Norway.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gabriel and Johanne were the parents of at least eight children:
2 CONT 1. Ingeborg (Gabrielson) Johnson
2 CONT 2. Gabriel Gabrielson
2 CONT 3. Hannah (Gabrielson) Leckburg
2 CONT 4. "Olive" Olivia (Gabrielson) Lawson
2 CONT 5. Gertrude Gabrielson
2 CONT 6. "William" Carl Wilhelm Gabrielson
2 CONT 7. Clara Serena (Gabrielson) Wester Gessner
2 CONT 8. Albert Gabrielson
2 CONT
2 CONT )
