2 GIVN Ole Johan Pederson
2 SURN Rægje
2 _MARNM Rege
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 25 AUG 1870
2 PLAC Rægje
2 ADDR
3 CITY Haaland (Sola)
3 STAE Rogaland
3 CTRY Norway
