2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT (should perhaps be Amund). If so, could he been the father of Jon Omundson Bo, Erlend Ommundson Vestly and Ivar Omundson referred to in letters arrived in avanittet. He could have been as son-son or daughter-son of Orm Ivarson. Ra
2 CONC mundt tax 3 ort 1563  Bygdabok - Naerbo, Rogaland, Norway.  Klepp book page 159 no. 6 and page 297 no. 7
