2 CONT
2 CONT In 1921 he lived in Alsen N Dak Then he moved to a farm east of Hampden N Dak and lived there until 1941 when he moved to a farm northeast of Hampden and lived there until 1949. Then he moved to a farm near Loma N Dak and lived th
2 CONC ere until he retired and moved to Devils Lake in November 1953. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He had three daughters with his wife Maria and three sons and four daughters totaling eleven children
2 CONT
2 CONT Written by his daughter Esther in 1997
