2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Fotland Family farm in the hamlet of Fotland, just south of Stvanger
2 CONT on the west coast of Norway.  Farm is still in the family, but passed
2 CONT down thru daughter (Hanna?) since all sons emigrated to America.
